WEBVTT

00:13:27.627 --> 00:13:31.189
a prvenstveno
se tiču vida.

00:13:31.189 --> 00:13:34.485
Kako se povećava,
tumor na hipofizi

00:13:34.485 --> 00:13:38.533
obično pritiska
vizuelni nerv u mozgu,

00:13:38.533 --> 00:13:41.037
što rezultira da
ljudi s akromegalijom

00:13:41.037 --> 00:13:46.508
ili duplo vide ili
su kratkovidi.

00:13:46.508 --> 00:13:49.101
Kada su ljudi počeli
da prave pretpostavke

00:13:49.101 --> 00:13:52.332
o tome šta nije u
redu s Golijatom,

00:13:52.332 --> 00:13:53.243
rekli su: "Čekaj malo,

00:13:53.243 --> 00:13:56.433
on veoma podseća na osobu

00:13:56.433 --> 00:13:58.006
koja ima akromegaliju."

00:13:58.006 --> 00:14:00.990
To bi objasnilo
mnoge čudne stvari